name: Bounded compatibility scope planning and honest source-only consumer readiness
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE NODE_OPTIONS NO_COLOR
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/legacy_scope_planner.py @TMP_TARGET @ART seed @TMP_HOME
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
submit: setg ui.auto_open_activity false
submit: setg ui.auto_open_viz false
submit: logs
submit: run campaign:plan {"campaignId":"standard","tool":"agentic-sast:scan","seasonPrompts":false}
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/legacy_scope_planner.py @TMP_TARGET @ART refused
paste-file: @ART/refusal-replay.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 REPLAY · Result | refusal-reader-ready
require-live-snap: 25 strategy=chunked. | unsupported-standard-scope
expect: No executable plan was published.
expect: campaign:study
keys: Escape
submit: run campaign:plan {"campaignId":"bounded","tool":"full-mode:hunt","seasonPrompts":false}
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/legacy_scope_planner.py @TMP_TARGET @ART planned
paste-file: @ART/plan-replay.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 REPLAY · Result | plan-reader-ready
require-live-snap: 25 Scope inventory: | inventory-receipt
expect: Compatibility draft only
expect: 1 truncated file prefixes
resize: 160x48
wait: 0.3
require-live-snap: 20 REPLAY · Result | plan-160x48
expect: Compatibility draft only
resize: 96x89
wait: 0.3
require-live-snap: 20 REPLAY · Result | plan-96x89
expect: Compatibility draft only
resize: 80x24
wait: 0.3
require-live-snap: 20 REPLAY · Result | plan-80x24
expect: Compatibility draft only
resize: 60x20
wait: 0.3
require-live-snap: 20 REPLAY · Result | plan-60x20
expect: Compatibility draft
resize: 40x12
wait: 0.3
require-live-snap: 20 Tab receipt | plan-40x12
keys: NPage
wait: 0.5
live-snap: plan-page-1-40x12
keys: NPage
wait: 0.5
live-snap: plan-page-2-40x12
keys: NPage
wait: 0.5
live-snap: plan-page-3-40x12
keys: NPage
wait: 0.5
live-snap: plan-page-4-40x12
keys: NPage
wait: 0.5
live-snap: plan-page-5-40x12
keys: NPage
wait: 0.5
live-snap: plan-page-6-40x12
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/legacy_scope_planner.py @TMP_TARGET @ART narrow
ask: Can the operator read the inventory limits, omissions and supported study route at all six sizes without mistaking this compatibility draft for completed analysis or approved work?
resize: 120x36
keys: Escape
paste-file: @ART/consumer-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/legacy_scope_planner.py @TMP_TARGET @ART consumed
paste-file: @ART/consumer-replay.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 REPLAY · Result | consumer-reader-ready
require-live-snap: 25 Planning only | exact-scope-consumer
expect: Cache reuse: disabled
keys: Escape
submit: run campaign:plan {"campaignId":"bounded","tool":"full-mode:hunt","seasonPrompts":false}
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/legacy_scope_planner.py @TMP_TARGET @ART reused
paste-file: @ART/reuse-replay.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 REPLAY · Result | reuse-reader-ready
require-live-snap: 25 already has a plan | preserved-plan
keys: Escape
submit: setup
require-live-snap: 25 Start Map | auxiliary-plans
ask: Does explicit dry-run consumption select only the two scope files, keep Map incomplete and refuse replacing the saved plan, with no provider requests or scan jobs?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
submit: logs
paste-file: @ART/plan-replay.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 REPLAY · Result | recovered-reader-ready
require-live-snap: 25 Compatibility draft only | recovered-plan
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/legacy_scope_planner.py @TMP_TARGET @ART restarted
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
